abstract: >-
  A bounded typed program synthesizer for the integer/list fragment of the
  DeepCoder DSL, combining execution-signature deduplication, optional
  neural-guided search ordering, and a one-turn oracle protocol.
  Packaged checkpoint SHA-256: a0f03d5066d86022d932699c1a6dfe68957d56131a38e7816e2085bda2000d41.
